WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:07.700
I wanted a ski holiday that never ended.

2
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:12.700
Build the lifts. Cut the runs.

3
00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:32.700
Apres-ski, on your terms.

4
00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:38.700
Even at night, the snowcats are out.

5
00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:43.700
And when the snow melts, summer begins.

6
00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:56.700
Skydive. Paraglide. Whatever you build.

7
00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:22.700
Your resort. Your seasons.
